en if the target doesn't know what language that is.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The duration is 8 hours.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"truespeech","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"uncommon","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":5},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"touch"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"1 hour","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"R3EX1pXLhd1YnD00","heightenedLevel":5},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.SwUiVavHKMWG7t5K","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"rQ8VtvMUfRSPuClt"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Reaction.webp","name":"Reactive Strike","system":{"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","description":{"value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ReactiveStrike]</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core","authors":""},"rules":[],"traits":{"value":[],"otherTags":[]},"slug":"reactive-strike","_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.W7SbTykXrNwxDzJc","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"p7mkoVan5nKaRMc4"},{"type":"action","name":"Fortune Vulnerability","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>A pruned future takes additional damage from attacks whose attack roll was altered by a fortune effect.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[{"key":"Weakness","type":"custom","definition":["item:trait:fortune"],"value":15}],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Actor.4smcNzAu4KRcmSr3.Item.4FQv0KdCU3ikHM2A","duplicateSource":"Actor.4smcNzAu4KRcmSr3.Item.4FQv0KdCU3ikHM2A","exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"_id":"XCXGCNYh8GUlVFkv"},{"type":"action","name":"Thoughtsense","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>The pruned future senses all non-mindless creatures in the listed range.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["mental","occult"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"interaction","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Actor.4smcNzAu4KRcmSr3.Item.VJijEMvpH9T3yGG5","duplicateSource":"Actor.4smcNzAu4KRcmSr3.Item.VJijEMvpH9T3yGG5","exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"_id":"7cPdFzCzgqcH2SB4"},{"type":"action","name":"Borrow Future","system":{"actionType":{"value":"free"},"description":{"value":"<p>At the beginning of their turn, a pruned future can gain 10 temporary Hit Points. The pruned future can't use this action if they are currently under any effects with the misfortune trait.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["occult","time"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.4.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","deathNote":false,"selfEffect":{"uuid":"Compendium.battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e.effects.Item.eP89YMdeikWvZgI3","name":"Effect: Borrow Future"}},"effects":[],"_id":"x77iAQELuq5k6nTg","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Split Future","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p>The pruned future branches their timeline temporarily and then decides between the two possible futures. The pruned future creates a temporal copy of themselves. Both they and their copy Stride up to their speed and roll a Strike against a different target. The pruned future then chooses which version of themselves is the true one. The true version's Strike occurs normally, while the copy disappears instead of harming their target. The copy has identical statistics to the original at the time the copying occurs, and any damage or conditions that the copy incurs do not affect the original.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["fortune","occult","time"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.4.1"}},"actions":{"value":3},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"QXK52IULrCuVpaEy","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Discern Stratagem","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p>The pruned future peers into a creature's future to prepare a killing blow. The pruned future attempts an @Check[occultism|against:will] check against the Will DC of a target they can sense, then makes a Strike against that target, automatically succeeding on any flat check due to the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{Concealed} or hidden conditions. If the Occultism check was a success, the pruned future rolls twice and takes the better result on the Strike.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["fortune","occult"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.4.1"}},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"i3RybyIuYRXgfJZt","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Fatal Fortune","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>A pruned future's melee and ranged Strikes gain the fatal d12 trait when benefiting from a fortune effect.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","option":"fortune-effect","toggleable":true,"label":"BZES.SpecificRule.TemporalParadox.FortuneToggleLabel"}],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.4.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"upLzFoAzhuNErFSJ","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"melee","name":"Pruning Shears","effects":[],"system":{"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null},"description":{"value":"","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[{"key":"ItemAlteration","itemId":"{item|id}","mode":"add","property":"traits","value":"fatal-d12","predicate":["fortune-effect"]}],"slug":"pruning-shears","traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["magical"]},"damageRolls":{"8XAfr6Ja1fkUGypE":{"damage":"4d8+15","damageType":"slashing","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":32},"attackEffects":{"value":["curse-of-unraveled-fate"]}},"_id":"ZyWDz72gtTKBPOKd","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.348","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Curse of Unraveled Fate","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>A creature struck by the pruned future's pruning shears must attempt a @Check[fortitude|dc:34] save as the frayed ends of the pruned future's fate tug on those of the creature.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TkIyaNPgTZFBCCuh]{Dazzled} for 1 round.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is dazzled for 1 round, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.3uh1r86TzbQvosxv]{Doomed 1}, and must roll twice and take the worse result on the next check it makes.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is dazzled for 1 minute, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.3uh1r86TzbQvosxv]{Doomed 2}, and must roll twice and take the worse result on every check it makes for 1 round.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["curse","misfortune","occult"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.4.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"JFq2NXEtztJ3bW8e","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"melee","name":"Force Bolt","effects":[],"system":{"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null},"description":{"value":"","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["force","magical","range-increment-60"]},"damageRolls":{"7KJm9kLKETjvG9Q6":{"damage":"3d10+15","damageType":"force","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":30},"attackEffects":{"value":[]}},"_id":"sCh2lk1ZsDKqMoEb","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}}],"effects":[],"sort":150000,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.8.0"}}